Add AMTAB Bari real-time (GTFS-RT via converter) to feeds/it.json,
directly after the existing static "Puglia-Bari" entry:

        {
            "name": "Puglia-Bari",
            "type": "url",
            "spec": "gtfs-rt",
            "url": "https://rt.example.org/trip-updates.pb",
            "license": {
                "spdx-identifier": "CC-BY-4.0",
                "url": "https://opendata.comune.bari.it/dataset/amtab-servizi-di-trasporto-sosta-e-mobilita",
                "publisher": "AMTAB S.p.A.",
                "publisher-url": "https://www.amtab.it/",
